/* ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
   BASE
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━ */
*, *::before, *::after {
  box-sizing: border-box;
  margin: 0;
  padding: 0;
}

html {
  scroll-behavior: smooth;
  -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
  -moz-osx-font-smoothing: grayscale;
  text-rendering: optimizeLegibility;
  scroll-padding-top: 5rem;
  hanging-punctuation: first last;
}

body {
  background-color: var(--color-bg);
  color: var(--color-text);
  font-family: Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;
  min-height: 100dvh;
  line-height: 1.6;
  transition:
    background-color 0.35s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1),
    color 0.25s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);
}

#root { min-height: 100dvh; }

img, picture, video, canvas, svg {
  display: block;
  max-width: 100%;
}

input, button, textarea, select { font: inherit; color: inherit; }

h1, h2, h3, h4, h5, h6 {
  text-wrap: balance;
  line-height: 1.2;
}

p, li, figcaption { text-wrap: pretty; max-width: 72ch; }

button { cursor: pointer; background: none; border: none; }

::selection {
  background: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.22);
  color: var(--color-text);
}

:focus-visible {
  outline: 2px solid #f59e0b;
  outline-offset: 3px;
  border-radius: 0.375rem;
}

@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
  *, *::before, *::after {
    animation-duration: 0.01ms !important;
    transition-duration: 0.01ms !important;
    scroll-behavior: auto !important;
  }
}

/* ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
   OVERRIDES DE CLASES TAILWIND HARDCODEADAS
   Solo afectan al modo CLARO; en .dark Tailwind
   mantiene los valores originales slate-*
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━ */

/* ── Texto ── */
.text-light         { color: var(--color-text)       !important; }
.text-slate-100     { color: var(--color-text)        !important; }
.text-slate-200     { color: var(--color-text)        !important; }
.text-slate-300     { color: var(--color-text-muted)  !important; }
.text-slate-400     { color: var(--color-text-muted)  !important; }
.text-slate-500     { color: var(--color-text-faint)  !important; }
.text-light\/70,
.text-light70       { color: var(--tw-text-light-70)  !important; }
.text-light\/50,
.text-light50       { color: var(--tw-text-light-50)  !important; }

/* ── Fondos (jerarquía de superficies) ── */
.bg-slate-950       { background-color: var(--color-bg)        !important; }
.bg-dark\/90,
.bg-dark90          { background-color: var(--color-nav-bg)    !important; }
.bg-slate-900,
.bg-slate-900\/50,
.bg-slate-90050     { background-color: var(--color-surface)   !important; }
.bg-slate-800,
.bg-slate-800\/50,
.bg-slate-80050,
.bg-slate-800\/30,
.bg-slate-80030,
.bg-slate-800\/70,
.bg-slate-80070     { background-color: var(--color-surface-2) !important; }
.bg-black\/80,
.bg-black80         { background-color: var(--tw-bg-black-80)  !important; }
.bg-black\/60,
.bg-black60         { background-color: var(--tw-bg-black-60)  !important; }
.bg-black\/40,
.bg-black40         { background-color: var(--tw-bg-black-40)  !important; }
.bg-white\/5,
.bg-white5          { background-color: var(--tw-bg-white-5)   !important; }

/* ── Bordes ── */
.border-slate-700,
.border-slate-800,
.border-slate-900   { border-color: var(--color-border)        !important; }
.border-primary\/20,
.border-primary20   { border-color: var(--tw-primary-20)       !important; }
.border-primary\/30,
.border-primary30   { border-color: var(--tw-primary-30)       !important; }
.border-primary\/40,
.border-primary40   { border-color: var(--tw-primary-40)       !important; }
.border-primary\/50,
.border-primary50   { border-color: var(--tw-primary-50)       !important; }

/* ── Hover de filas ── */
.hover\:bg-slate-900:hover,
.hover\:bg-slate-800:hover,
.hover\:bg-slate-700:hover { background-color: var(--color-row-hover) !important; }

/* ── Inputs y selects globales ── */
input:not([type="checkbox"]):not([type="radio"]):not([type="range"]):not([type="color"]),
textarea,
select {
  background-color: var(--color-input-bg)     !important;
  border-color:     var(--color-input-border) !important;
  color:            var(--color-input-text)   !important;
  transition:
    background-color 0.25s ease,
    border-color     0.25s ease,
    box-shadow       0.2s  ease;
}
input::placeholder,
textarea::placeholder { color: var(--color-text-faint) !important; }
input:focus,
textarea:focus,
select:focus {
  border-color: var(--color-input-focus) !important;
  box-shadow: var(--shadow-glow-gold)    !important;
  outline: none;
}

/* ── Navbar pública ── */
nav.sticky {
  background-color: var(--color-nav-bg) !important;
  backdrop-filter: blur(14px) saturate(1.4);
  -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(14px) saturate(1.4);
}
nav .text-light      { color: var(--color-nav-text)     !important; }
nav .text-slate-400  { color: var(--color-nav-text-sub) !important; }

/* ── Modales con rounding ── */
.bg-slate-900.rounded-2xl,
.bg-slate-900.rounded-xl {
  background-color: var(--color-modal-bg)     !important;
  border-color:     var(--color-modal-border) !important;
}

/* ── Patrón general: cards con bg-slate + border + rounded ── */
[class*="bg-slate-900"][class*="rounded"][class*="border"] {
  background-color: var(--color-surface) !important;
  border-color:     var(--color-border)  !important;
  color:            var(--color-text)    !important;
}

/* ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
   @layer components — CLASES SEMÁNTICAS
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━ */
@layer components {

  /* ── Cards ── */
  .card-soft {
    background-color: var(--color-surface);
    background-image: var(--gradient-surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-card);
    border-radius: 0.875rem;
    transition:
      background 0.3s ease,
      border-color 0.3s ease,
      box-shadow 0.25s ease,
      transform 0.2s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1);
  }
  .card-soft:hover {
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg);
    transform: translateY(-1px);
    border-color: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.20);
  }

  .card-inner {
    background-color: var(--color-inner-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-inner-border);
    border-radius: 0.75rem;
    transition: background-color 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;
  }
  .card-inner:hover {
    background-color: var(--color-row-hover);
    border-color: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.18);
  }

  /* ── Tipografía semántica ── */
  .t-heading  { color: var(--color-text);        font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.01em; }
  .t-body     { color: var(--color-text); }
  .t-muted    { color: var(--color-text-muted); }
  .t-faint    { color: var(--color-text-faint); }
  .text-muted      { color: var(--color-text-muted); }
  .text-faint      { color: var(--color-text-faint); }
  .text-muted-soft { color: var(--color-text-faint); }

  /* ── Divisores ── */
  .divider {
    height: 1px;
    background: linear-gradient(
      to right,
      transparent,
      var(--color-divider) 20%,
      var(--color-divider) 80%,
      transparent
    );
    border: none;
  }

  /* ── Input temático ── */
  .input-themed {
    background-color: var(--color-input-bg);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-input-border);
    color: var(--color-input-text);
    border-radius: 0.5rem;
    padding: 0.5rem 0.75rem;
    width: 100%;
    transition:
      background-color 0.25s ease,
      border-color     0.25s ease,
      box-shadow       0.2s  ease;
  }
  .input-themed::placeholder { color: var(--color-text-faint); }
  .input-themed:focus {
    outline: none;
    border-color: var(--color-input-focus);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-glow-gold);
  }

  /* ── Botón dorado premium ── */
  .button-gold {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 0.4rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    border-radius: 9999px;
    padding: 0.5rem 1.375rem;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    background: var(--gradient-gold);
    color: #111827;
    border: 1px solid rgba(251, 191, 36, 0.6);
    box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(245,158,11,0.30), 0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.10);
    cursor: pointer;
    text-decoration: none;
    letter-spacing: 0.01em;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    transition:
      filter    0.15s ease,
      transform 0.15s ease,
      box-shadow 0.15s ease;
  }
  .button-gold::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.18) 0%, transparent 60%);
    border-radius: inherit;
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  .button-gold:hover {
    filter: brightness(1.07);
    transform: translateY(-1px);
    box-shadow: 0 4px 18px rgba(245,158,11,0.42), 0 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.12);
  }
  .button-gold:active {
    transform: translateY(0);
    filter: brightness(0.96);
    box-shadow: 0 1px 4px rgba(245,158,11,0.25);
  }

  /* ── Botón paginación ── */
  .btn-page {
    background-color: var(--color-surface-2);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    border-radius: 0.625rem;
    padding: 0.5rem 0.875rem;
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition:
      background-color 0.2s ease,
      border-color     0.2s ease,
      color            0.2s ease,
      box-shadow       0.2s ease;
  }
  .btn-page:hover {
    border-color: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.50);
    color: #d97706;
    background-color: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.06);
  }
  .btn-page.active {
    background: var(--gradient-gold);
    color: #111827;
    border-color: #f59e0b;
    box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(245,158,11,0.28);
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  .btn-page:disabled { opacity: 0.38; cursor: not-allowed; }

  /* ── Toggle de tema ── */
  .theme-toggle {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    width: 2.25rem;
    height: 2.25rem;
    border-radius: 0.625rem;
    background: var(--color-toggle-bg);
    color: var(--color-toggle-icon);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    cursor: pointer;
    transition:
      background   0.2s ease,
      color        0.2s ease,
      border-color 0.2s ease,
      transform    0.15s ease;
  }
  .theme-toggle:hover {
    background: var(--color-toggle-hover);
    color: #f59e0b;
    border-color: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.30);
    transform: scale(1.08);
  }
  .theme-toggle:active { transform: scale(0.94); }

  /* ── Tooltip ── */
  .tooltip-surface {
    background-color: var(--color-surface-2);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg);
    color: var(--color-text);
    border-radius: 0.75rem;
    backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
    transition: background-color 0.25s ease;
  }

  /* ── Línea de sección ── */
  .section-divider-line {
    flex: 1;
    height: 1px;
    background: linear-gradient(
      to right,
      var(--color-divider),
      transparent
    );
  }

  /* ── Banner de perfil ── */
  .profile-banner {
    background: linear-gradient(
      175deg,
      var(--color-banner-from)  0%,
      var(--color-banner-mid)  45%,
      var(--color-banner-to)  100%
    );
    transition: background 0.4s ease;
  }

  /* ── Stat pill ── */
  .stat-pill {
    background-color: var(--color-surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: 0.875rem;
    padding: 0.5rem 1rem;
    backdrop-filter: blur(6px);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
    transition:
      background-color 0.25s ease,
      border-color     0.25s ease,
      box-shadow       0.2s  ease;
  }
  .stat-pill:hover {
    border-color: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.28);
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(245,158,11,0.08), var(--shadow-sm);
  }

  /* ── Barra de completitud ── */
  .completion-track {
    height: 0.5rem;
    background: linear-gradient(
      to right,
      var(--color-surface-off),
      var(--color-inner-card)
    );
    border-radius: 9999px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  /* ── Recharts tooltip ── */
  .recharts-tooltip-themed {
    background-color: var(--color-surface-2) !important;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border)    !important;
    border-radius: 0.625rem                  !important;
    color: var(--color-text)                 !important;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg)             !important;
  }

  /* ── Settings FAB panel ── */
  .settings-fab-panel {
    background-color: var(--color-surface-2);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    color: var(--color-text);
    border-radius: 1.125rem;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg);
    backdrop-filter: blur(16px) saturate(1.3);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(16px) saturate(1.3);
  }
  .settings-fab-btn {
    background-color: var(--color-surface-off);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    border-radius: 0.75rem;
    transition:
      background-color 0.2s ease,
      border-color     0.2s ease,
      color            0.2s ease;
  }
  .settings-fab-btn:hover {
    background-color: var(--color-row-hover);
    border-color: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.28);
    color: #d97706;
  }

  /* ── Badge de estado ── */
  .badge {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.3rem;
    padding: 0.2rem 0.625rem;
    border-radius: 9999px;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    border: 1px solid currentColor;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  /* ── Tabla ── */
  .table-themed tbody tr {
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-divider);
    transition: background-color 0.15s ease;
  }
  .table-themed tbody tr:hover {
    background-color: var(--color-row-hover);
  }
  .table-themed tbody tr:nth-child(even) {
    background-color: var(--color-row-stripe);
  }

  /* ── Scrollbar personalizado ── */
  .scrollbar-thin::-webkit-scrollbar       { width: 6px; height: 6px; }
  .scrollbar-thin::-webkit-scrollbar-track { background: transparent; }
  .scrollbar-thin::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {
    background: var(--color-border);
    border-radius: 9999px;
  }
  .scrollbar-thin::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover {
    background: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.35);
  }
}

/* ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
   OVERRIDES ESPECÍFICOS POR COMPONENTE
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━ */

/* Navbar */
nav.sticky .text-light,
nav.sticky .hover\:text-primary {
  color: var(--color-nav-text);
}

/* Property cards */
.property-card-info {
  background-color: var(--color-surface) !important;
  color: var(--color-text)               !important;
}

/* ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
   ANIMACIONES
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━ */
@keyframes spin-slow {
  from { transform: rotate(0deg);   }
  to   { transform: rotate(360deg); }
}

@keyframes fade-in {
  from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(8px); }
  to   { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0);   }
}

@keyframes fade-up {
  from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(16px); }
  to   { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0);    }
}

@keyframes shimmer {
  0%   { background-position: -200% 0; }
  100% { background-position:  200% 0; }
}

@keyframes pulse-gold {
  0%, 100% { box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(245,158,11,0.0); }
  50%       { box-shadow: 0 0 0 6px rgba(245,158,11,0.12); }
}

@keyframes scale-in {
  from { opacity: 0; transform: scale(0.95); }
  to   { opacity: 1; transform: scale(1);    }
}

.animate-spin-slow  { animation: spin-slow  8s linear infinite; }
.animate-fade-in    { animation: fade-in    0.3s ease forwards; }
.animate-fade-up    { animation: fade-up    0.4s cubic-bezier(0.16,1,0.3,1) forwards; }
.animate-scale-in   { animation: scale-in   0.25s cubic-bezier(0.34,1.56,0.64,1) forwards; }
.animate-pulse-gold { animation: pulse-gold 2.4s ease-in-out infinite; }
.page-transition    { animation: fade-in    0.28s cubic-bezier(0.4,0,0.2,1) forwards; }

/* ── Skeleton loader ── */
.skeleton {
  background: linear-gradient(
    90deg,
    var(--color-surface-off) 25%,
    var(--color-row-hover)   50%,
    var(--color-surface-off) 75%
  );
  background-size: 200% 100%;
  animation: shimmer 1.6s ease-in-out infinite;
  border-radius: 0.375rem;
}
</file>

